WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.640
Learn from your mistakes, while you work.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.570
Learning Workspace guides you as you write.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.350
Feedback at every step, right where you need it.

4
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:29.150
When something goes wrong, you see exactly where to look.

5
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:33.190
A nudge that helps you understand, without taking over.

6
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.650
Then, practice built around what you need to learn.

7
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.810
So the next time, you’re ready.

8
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.170
Don’t just find your mistakes.

9
00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:54.070
Stop repeating them.
